{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼宣佈將從2028年1月起停止生產PlayStation遊戲實體光盤，玩家由此對數字所有權和二手遊戲市場消失表達反對。Alinea Analytics市場分析主管Rhys Elliott將反對者稱為「聲音響亮的少數」，認為這部分玩家雖然可能投入不少，但對整體收入的貢獻有限。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583536.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.487848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_hash":"43beea7789ebaebd7fafbc46420b471b686e9f5cd8dc17cbb0b0e2de8d5ceec8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}